Sortons-la de là.

147
00:12:33,502 --> 00:12:34,921
Pas Hale.

148
00:12:35,421 --> 00:12:36,630
McCall.

149
00:12:37,799 --> 00:12:39,216
Scott McCall.

150
00:12:51,187 --> 00:12:52,563
L'APPEL DE LA FORÊT

151
